{
  "question": "You are part of a healthcare organization where data is organized and managed by respective data owners in various storage services. As a result of this decentralized ecosystem, discovering and managing data has become difficult. You need to quickly identify and implement a cost-optimized solution to assist your organization with the following:\u2022\tData management and discovery\u2022\tData lineage tracking\u2022\tData quality validationHow should you build the solution?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse BigLake to convert the current solution into a data lake architecture.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tB.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBuild a new data discovery tool on Google Kubernetes Engine that helps with new source onboarding and data lineage tracking.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tC.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse BigQuery to track data lineage, and use Dataprep to manage data and perform data quality validation.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tD.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse Dataplex to manage data, track data lineage, and perform data quality validation.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\nShow Suggested Answer\nHide Answer\n\nSuggested Answer:\nD\n\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f",
